From 6ae8c8d6d78a81dc3850070f9c3d9a919f2135c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agent <agent@local>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:17:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lean-categories#95: register the finite-subset inclusion into
 the power set
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

`CasCatalogue.Foundation.FiniteSubsets.inclusion` (`𝒫_fin(X) ↪ 𝒫(X)`) and its `Mono`
instance were already declared but unregistered, so the catalogue did not expose the
natural inclusion that research#606 reads off the finite-subset object. This adds the
`normalized_registry .inclusion` row `incl.sets.finite_subsets` with
`sub := obj.sets.finite_subsets`, `super := obj.sets.power_set`, `parameterization`
defaulting to `.shared`, and `mono := CasCatalogue.Foundation.FiniteSubsets.inclusion_mono`.

The entry is accepted by the registry's own `validateInclusion`: the category and both
objects resolve, the declaration is a morphism of `CategoryId.sets`, its endpoints use the
shared parameter, and the named proof is `Mono` of that exact arrow. No declaration, no
statement and no existing registration is changed.
---
 .../Catalogue/Semantics/Foundation/FiniteSubsets.lean       | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/LeanCategories/Catalogue/Semantics/Foundation/FiniteSubsets.lean b/LeanCategories/Catalogue/Semantics/Foundation/FiniteSubsets.lean
index 55682c0..d9d75bc 100644
--- a/LeanCategories/Catalogue/Semantics/Foundation/FiniteSubsets.lean
+++ b/LeanCategories/Catalogue/Semantics/Foundation/FiniteSubsets.lean
@@ -148,4 +148,10 @@ normalized_registry .object
     admission := some `CasCatalogue.Foundation.FiniteSubsets.admit
     evidence := some `CasCatalogue.Foundation.FiniteSubsets.finiteSubsetEvidence }
 
+normalized_registry .inclusion
+  { id := ⟨"incl.sets.finite_subsets"⟩, category := CategoryId.sets
+    sub := ⟨"obj.sets.finite_subsets"⟩, super := ⟨"obj.sets.power_set"⟩
+    declaration := `CasCatalogue.Foundation.FiniteSubsets.inclusion
+    mono := `CasCatalogue.Foundation.FiniteSubsets.inclusion_mono }
+
 end CasCatalogue
